# Trust list for this repository, read by workflows/pr-vouch.yml.
#
# People with write access to the repository, and bots, are trusted automatically and do not belong here. List an
# outside contributor to mark their pull requests vouch:trusted; a pull request from anyone else is labeled
# vouch:unvouched. The label only helps a maintainer decide how closely to look; it blocks nothing.
#
# Syntax:
#   github:username
#   -github:username reason for denouncing
#
# Keep entries sorted alphabetically.
